            <div id="cite-standard" class="tab " role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-4" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true">
                <div class="rendering rendering_researchoutput  rendering_researchoutput_standard rendering_workingpaper rendering_standard rendering_workingpaper_standard"><a rel="WorkingPaper" href="https://onderzoeksportaal.fontys.nl/en/publications/benchmarking-energy-efficiency-of-large-language-models-using-vll/" class="link"><span><strong>Benchmarking Energy Efficiency of Large Language Models Using vLLM.</strong></span></a> / Pronk, K.<a rel="Person" href="https://onderzoeksportaal.fontys.nl/en/persons/qin-zhao/" class="link"><span>; Zhao, Q.</span></a> <br />2025.<p class="type"><span class="type_family">Research output<span class="type_family_sep">: </span></span><span class="type_classification_parent">Working paper<span class="type_parent_sep"> › </span></span><span class="type_classification">Preprint</span><span class="type_classification"><span class="type_parent_sep"> › </span>Scientific</span></p></div>
